From 532eda40822cb7b26c782720a72fbd455546297e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tanmay Varun <varuntanmay21@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:11:31 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(agent): preserve earned patient progress, not mere
 visibility

Patient authority now requires prior retrieval/binding (content_located or
content-role SEARCH choice). Drop phase/document_locates as commitment
evidence; scope affordance repair to established_patient_ref; treat absence
as grounding loss, not identity contradiction.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
